00:18:36.740 --> 00:18:39.160
I'm just sitting in line at
Starbucks like the rest of us,

00:18:39.160 --> 00:18:42.960
so, I have some work to do
before I look like The Rock

00:18:42.960 --> 00:18:45.900
or Jason Statham, or decide
to save the world, so.

00:18:45.900 --> 00:18:48.450
Our last topic here today is a question

00:18:48.450 --> 00:18:50.700
more about the future of Fast &amp; Furious

00:18:50.700 --> 00:18:53.020
or Fast &amp; Furious Presents and Sharronda,

00:18:53.020 --> 00:18:54.380
I wanna go to you first on this.

00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:57.930
Is this the way that you would like to see

00:18:57.930 --> 00:19:00.790
the Hobbs and Shaw characters
continue their adventures?

00:19:00.790 --> 00:19:04.120
Do you want this to stay
away from the main franchise?

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:06.310
Because there's just little winks and nods

00:19:06.310 --> 00:19:07.143
