00:19:18.600 --> 00:19:20.200
yes, I am gonna bring that up again

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:22.200
'cause it's very important to me.

00:19:22.200 --> 00:19:24.560
But I do think that it
needs to stay separate.

00:19:24.560 --> 00:19:26.320
But I do think that even Hobbs &amp; Shaw

00:19:26.320 --> 00:19:28.610
