00:19:32.500 --> 00:19:34.460
what they need to help her steal next.

00:19:34.460 --> 00:19:35.910
I think that there are so many characters

00:19:35.910 --> 00:19:38.020
that they've introduced
into this franchise

00:19:38.020 --> 00:19:39.357
that I want to see it expand.

00:19:39.357 --> 00:19:42.340
I want to see more, not only of just them,

00:19:42.340 --> 00:19:45.330
but the people that they're
kinda in contact with as well.

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:46.470
- Yeah, Nikki, do you think

00:19:46.470 --> 00:19:48.320
that Vin Diesel's
getting a little nervous?

00:19:48.320 --> 00:19:50.713
Like we got this whole
other spin-off franchise

00:19:50.713 --> 00:19:52.860
that maybe doesn't need to be incorporated

00:19:52.860 --> 00:19:54.458
into future Fast &amp; Furious films.

00:19:54.458 --> 00:19:55.640
- I think he's just fine.

00:19:55.640 --> 00:19:57.910
I think he's doing just fine.

00:19:57.910 --> 00:19:59.180
They're keeping things very separate.

00:19:59.180 --> 00:20:01.030
They've sort of made their mark here.

00:20:01.886 --> 00:20:03.470
What I like about this is

00:20:03.470 --> 00:20:05.930
they've gone in many different
directions with this film.

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:07.440
It felt a little Mission Impossible,

00:20:07.440 --> 00:20:08.740
it felt a little Fast &amp; Furious,

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:10.560
it felt a little old school buddy cop.

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:12.180
So I feel like they can sort of hone in

00:20:12.180 --> 00:20:13.210
on what really worked,

00:20:13.210 --> 00:20:14.780
and it can really go in any direction.

00:20:14.780 --> 00:20:17.210
And you think about the Fast
franchise, how it evolved,

00:20:17.210 --> 00:20:20.410
I'd like to see them go more
over the top with cameos,

00:20:20.410 --> 00:20:22.480
more over the top with their relationship.

00:20:22.480 --> 00:20:24.170
Even the family stuff with The Rock

00:20:24.170 --> 00:20:25.380
I don't think was explored enough.

00:20:25.380 --> 00:20:27.360
I think Eiza Gonzales
could even come back.

00:20:27.360 --> 00:20:29.380
There's potential, potential for Idris.

00:20:29.380 --> 00:20:31.190
So there's a lot of
different ways they can go,

00:20:31.190 --> 00:20:32.490
and hopefully they go in the right one.

00:20:32.490 --> 00:20:33.870
- Yeah, Carlos, I think
you made the point earlier

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:37.320
that it felt like maybe some
of the individual scenes

00:20:37.320 --> 00:20:39.740
felt different than a
normal Fast &amp; Furious movie,

00:20:39.740 --> 00:20:42.000
partially because it is
direction David Leitch,

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:43.440
and like you said, your cameos.

00:20:43.440 --> 00:20:46.810
He's got Ryan Reynolds, Rob
Delaney pops in from Deadpool 2.

00:20:46.810 --> 00:20:47.950
And when you look at this,

00:20:47.950 --> 00:20:49.890
is that how you'd like
the films to continue

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:51.930
or do you wanna see them just take this

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:53.310
and the events of this movie

00:20:53.310 --> 00:20:56.940
