00:21:04.013 --> 00:21:05.850
with all the Fast &amp; Furious characters

00:21:05.850 --> 00:21:06.830
and the ones that they've introduced here.

00:21:06.830 --> 00:21:08.100
So I think, to me,

00:21:08.100 --> 00:21:10.680
that's probably where the
franchise is going to.

00:21:10.680 --> 00:21:12.370
Make a couple more
movies in this franchise.

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:14.310
Maybe develop another one
with another character

00:21:14.310 --> 00:21:15.730
and then bring them all together.

00:21:15.730 --> 00:21:18.360
- Okay so, you wanna
see them spin this off

00:21:18.360 --> 00:21:19.207
a little bit further.
- Right.

00:21:19.207 --> 00:21:22.010
- And then maybe have a giant
like, Avengers Infinity War,

00:21:22.010 --> 00:21:24.270
Endgame, reuniting of everything.

00:21:24.270 --> 00:21:27.470
Sharronda, where do you wanna
see the Hobbs &amp; Shaw franchise

00:21:27.470 --> 00:21:28.833
go from here?

00:21:30.300 --> 00:21:32.800
- I just want to see it
expand bigger and bigger.

00:21:32.800 --> 00:21:35.765
I want to definitely see more women.

00:21:35.765 --> 00:21:37.950
I thought they did a very great job

00:21:37.950 --> 00:21:39.600
with Vanessa Kirby's character.

00:21:39.600 --> 00:21:41.360
Just to see that expand,

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:43.850
and not just be a damsel
in distress situation,

00:21:43.850 --> 00:21:46.630
which they didn't do in this movie.

00:21:46.630 --> 00:21:49.170
But I do wanna see them
introduce more characters,

00:21:49.170 --> 00:21:52.170
and I would love to see
like, this big, you know,

00:21:52.170 --> 00:21:54.180
just finale with everyone.

00:21:54.180 --> 00:21:55.760
And even with the previous.

00:21:55.760 --> 00:21:57.470
Can we get some like, Tokyo Drift people

00:21:57.470 --> 00:21:59.500
even to just like, pop back in as well?

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:01.586
I would be very happy to see that, too.

00:22:01.586 --> 00:22:03.823
- So, justice for Tokyo Drift now.

00:22:05.350 --> 00:22:07.660
Nikki, I'm gonna give you a carte blanche.

00:22:07.660 --> 00:22:09.070
We got the Fast &amp; Furious movies,

00:22:09.070 --> 00:22:10.920
we have the spin off with Hobbs &amp; Shaw.

00:22:10.920 --> 00:22:13.340
Any other franchises that you wanna see

00:22:13.340 --> 00:22:16.890
be mixed into this world,
into that cookie batter

00:22:16.890 --> 00:22:21.890
as we progress down this
blockbuster combination film route?

00:22:22.240 --> 00:22:24.010
- To be mixed in with the Fast
&amp; Furious and Hobbs &amp; Shaw?

00:22:24.010 --> 00:22:27.220
- Sure, I'll give you something as easy as

00:22:27.220 --> 00:22:28.900
maybe a John Wick,

00:22:28.900 --> 00:22:31.080
or something on that order, Expendables.

00:22:31.080 --> 00:22:32.970
- Well, you gave me an easy answer.

00:22:32.970 --> 00:22:35.560
'Cause I think there were
some Keanu Reeves rumors

00:22:35.560 --> 00:22:36.693
that he was gonna be in this film.

00:22:36.693 --> 00:22:39.230
I mean, if David Leitch
continues to direct,

00:22:39.230 --> 00:22:40.350
there's no reason why he couldn't.

00:22:40.350 --> 00:22:42.290
You just gave me my answer, basically.

00:22:42.290 --> 00:22:43.680
- Well good, because that also sets up

00:22:43.680 --> 00:22:45.090
our next little point here is that

