00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:15.590
I don't know.

00:23:15.590 --> 00:23:17.140
It just didn't work for me.

00:23:17.140 --> 00:23:19.680
I thought like, I don't know.

00:23:19.680 --> 00:23:22.160
She just didn't fit into
the franchise to me,

00:23:22.160 --> 00:23:23.740
