00:23:23.740 --> 00:23:24.573
to wanna see more.

00:23:24.573 --> 00:23:26.630
- Okay, so we'll keep her
buried as far as Nikki goes.

00:23:26.630 --> 00:23:30.660
Carlos, what do you hope the
fall out is from the voice?

00:23:30.660 --> 00:23:32.240
Like what is gonna happen with the voice?

00:23:32.240 --> 00:23:33.770
