00:24:27.770 --> 00:24:30.050
What is the best Fast &amp; Furious film?

00:24:30.050 --> 00:24:31.740
- I mean, for sentimental reasons,

00:24:31.740 --> 00:24:35.960
I have to go with Fast &amp; Furious 7.

00:24:35.960 --> 00:24:37.290
If I wanna say the one that like,

00:24:37.290 --> 00:24:40.360
really brought the whole
franchise back, it would be Five.

00:24:40.360 --> 00:24:41.520
- Yeah, absolutely Five.

00:24:41.520 --> 00:24:42.950
